    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_reception_01",
      "hash64": "B94DB1F7E154384B",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)] 님이시군요!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_reception_02",
      "hash64": "B94DB2F7E15439FE",
      "text": "챔피언전의\\n신청 수속을 진행하겠습니다.\\r\\n잠시 기다려 주세요.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_03",
      "hash64": "6A5BBAE1902FB17F",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]...\\n너, 카지랑 친했었지?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
